50
00:04:12,159 --> 00:04:14,560
[SPEAKER_01] Ne, pod simpatiju sam stavio na drugu djevojku.

51
00:04:15,039 --> 00:04:15,439
[SPEAKER_00] Za Jana.

52
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:16,800
[SPEAKER_01] Kožiš, da.

53
00:04:17,519 --> 00:04:18,319
[SPEAKER_00] Opasno od rada.

54
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:19,680
[SPEAKER_01] Kožiš, kožiš.

55
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:21,120
[SPEAKER_01] Ali.

56
00:04:22,639 --> 00:04:23,439
[SPEAKER_00] Tako da Lara.

57
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:25,360
[SPEAKER_01] Da, samo Lara.

58
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:28,240
[SPEAKER_01] Dobro, što je Lara Škrinjar, ali za mene Lara.

59
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:30,959
[SPEAKER_01] Danas bi možda odgovori bili drugačiji, ali...

60
00:04:31,759 --> 00:04:32,160
[SPEAKER_01] Danas nisam...

61
00:04:33,519 --> 00:04:37,680
[SPEAKER_01] Nisam imao baš neku osobu za koju sam mislio.

62
00:04:37,839 --> 00:04:40,160
[SPEAKER_01] O, wow, ja želim biti tučno ko ti.

63
00:04:40,399 --> 00:04:44,959
