75
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:16,959
[SPEAKER_01] Nažalost, ne.

76
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:17,439
[SPEAKER_01] Ne.

77
00:05:18,399 --> 00:05:23,199
[SPEAKER_01] Znam tko sam bio, znam da sam bio smatljivo čaran, ali.

78
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:24,879
