155
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:57,039
[SPEAKER_01] do 1970.

156
00:10:57,600 --> 00:10:58,799
[SPEAKER_01] i surovi od 70.

157
00:10:58,960 --> 00:10:59,440
[SPEAKER_01] pa do danas.

158
00:11:00,559 --> 00:11:04,480
