478
00:37:44,559 --> 00:37:45,840
[SPEAKER_01] Ali kao, ok, ok.

479
00:37:46,719 --> 00:37:47,280
[SPEAKER_01] Amo raditi.

480
00:37:47,519 --> 00:37:48,000
[SPEAKER_01] Amo raditi.

481
00:37:48,400 --> 00:37:49,360
