00:45:41,840 --> 00:45:42,960
[SPEAKER_01] Nećemo nikad znati.

595
00:45:43,039 --> 00:45:44,000
[SPEAKER_00] I to ostaje misteriozno.

596
00:45:44,239 --> 00:45:45,199
[SPEAKER_01] Nećemo nikad znati.

597
00:45:46,639 --> 00:45:46,719
[SPEAKER_01] Ali.

598
00:45:49,440 --> 00:45:54,800
[SPEAKER_01] Tako čudno je kada mi se onda da da nekog dobricu, onda sam si tako dosadan.

599
00:45:55,840 --> 00:45:57,199
