[SPEAKER_01] Da, da, da.

1192
01:33:34,399 --> 01:33:35,760
[SPEAKER_01] Ne, ne, ne, ne.

1193
01:33:36,479 --> 01:33:39,680
[SPEAKER_00] Mi ćemo tvoje potvrdčuje ono, day in the life, Jana Kovic.

1194
01:33:40,640 --> 01:33:41,119
[SPEAKER_00] Dobro, govoriš.

1195
01:33:41,279 --> 01:33:46,640
[SPEAKER_01] Dobro, govoriš, ali da, ne bih bio.

1196
01:33:47,119 --> 01:33:49,439
[SPEAKER_01] ono youtuber, ali bih volio biti na ono.

1197
01:33:49,760 --> 01:33:50,720
[SPEAKER_01] Bio bih iza kulisa.

1198
01:33:50,880 --> 01:33:51,760
[SPEAKER_01] Bio bih iza kulisa.

1199
01:33:52,319 --> 01:33:55,359
[SPEAKER_01] Meni još uvijek jako privlači filmska režija.

1200
01:33:55,840 --> 01:34:00,479
